-- Opinion column by Shaheen Arif, Editor (2026-11-27): Nvidia's board reinstating Jensen Huang.
-- The editor read the draft and asked on 2026-11-27 to publish it under Opinion. It loads as an EDITORIAL_REVIEW draft in
-- Columns (under Opinion); the editor approves it in /admin to publish, as with every newsroom story.
-- Text is the draft he read, plus the standard opinion line at the end. The reported intelligence link is attributed and
-- framed as unproven; the column makes no claim that Huang spied or broke any law.
